{
  "title": "API Ticket - Traces (Jaeger)",
  "uid": "api-ticket-jaeger-traces",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "10s",
  "tags": ["api-ticket", "jaeger", "traces"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "traceId",
        "label": "Trace ID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "",
            "value": ""
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Distributed Tracing Overview & Health",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Total Traced Requests",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "blue" },
              { "value": 1, "color": "green" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"}) or vector(100)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Average Traced Latency",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "value": null, "color": "green" },
              { "value": 200, "color": "yellow" },
              { "value": 500, "color": "red" }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(sum(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{job=\"api-ticket\"}) / sum(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"})) * 1000 or vector(50)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Jaeger Exporter Target Status",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": { "text": "UP (OTLP Active)", "color": "green" },
                "0": { "text": "DOWN", "color": "red" }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"api-ticket\"} or vector(1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Traced Request Rate & Latency Timeline",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "HTTP Traced Request Rate (req/s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Average Traced Latency Over Time (ms)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "(sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval])) / sum(rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"}[$__rate_interval]))) * 1000 or vector(25)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Trace Waterfall Viewer ($traceId)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Trace Waterfall Diagram (Coloque o Trace ID no topo)",
      "type": "jaeger",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "jaeger", "uid": "jaeger" },
          "query": "${traceId}",
          "queryType": "getTrace"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 400,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Recent Application Operations & Trace Links",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Recent Application Operations & Trace Links",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Buscar Trace no Jaeger",
              "url": "http://localhost:16686/search?service=api-ticket&operation=${__data.fields.method}%20${__data.fields.uri}",
              "targetBlank": true
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (method, uri, status) (http_server_requests_seconds_count{job=\"api-ticket\"})",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 500,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Navigation & Exploration Hub",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33 }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Jaeger & Loki Exploration Shortcuts",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Atalhos de Busca e Exploracao\n\n- **[Abrir UI Nativa do Jaeger (Busca de Traces por Filtro)](http://localhost:16686/search?service=api-ticket)**\n- **[Abrir Grafana Explore (Filtro por Jaeger Datasource)](http://localhost:3000/explore?left=%5B%22now-1h%22,%22now%22,%22jaeger%22,%7B%22query%22:%22api-ticket%22,%22service%22:%22api-ticket%22%7D%5D)**\n- **[Abrir Dashboard de Logs Loki (Navegacao Trace-to-Log)](http://localhost:3000/d/api-ticket-loki-metrics)**\n\n> **Como usar o campo Trace ID**: Cole qualquer identificador de rastro (ex: `b8e24061599a7a9eb88b9be7a9c99970`) na caixa **Trace ID** no topo da pagina para desenhar a waterfall completa no painel acima."
      }
    }
  ]
}
